{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 62,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the choirmaster. According to Jeduthun. A Psalm of David. In God alone my soul finds rest; my salvation comes from Him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He alone is my rock and my salvation. He is my fortress; I will never be shaken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How long will you threaten a man? Will all of you throw him down like a leaning wall or a tottering fence?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They fully intend to cast him down from his lofty perch; they delight in lies; with their mouths they bless, but inwardly they curse. Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rest in God alone, O my soul, for my hope comes from Him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He alone is my rock and my salvation; He is my fortress; I will not be shaken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My salvation and my honor rest on God, my strong rock; my refuge is in God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Trust in Him at all times, O people; pour out your hearts before Him. God is our refuge. Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lowborn men are but a vapor; the exalted are but a lie. Weighed on the scale, they go up; together they are but a vapor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Place no trust in extortion or false hope in stolen goods. If your riches increase, do not set your heart upon them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God has spoken once; I have heard this twice: that power belongs to God,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.62.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.62.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and loving devotion to You, O Lord. For You will repay each man according to his deeds.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
